sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Data Scientist<br/>kubectl / SDK
    participant UI as ml-pipeline-ui<br/>80/TCP → 3000
    participant API as ml-pipeline API Server<br/>8887 gRPC / 8888 REST
    participant WH as Admission Webhooks<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.4<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as SeaweedFS (S3)<br/>8333/TCP
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant Driver as Driver / Launcher
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant MW as Metadata Writer
    participant Envoy as Metadata Envoy<br/>9090/TCP
    participant MLMD as Metadata gRPC Store<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Cache as Cache Server<br/>443/TCP

    Note over Client,Cache: Pipeline Submission Flow
    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>Bearer Token
    API->>K8s: TokenReview (validate token)<br/>authentication.k8s.io
    K8s-->>API: Token valid + user identity
    API->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview<br/>authorization.k8s.io
    K8s-->>API: Authorized
    API->>MySQL: Store pipeline metadata<br/>Istio mTLS
    API->>S3: Store pipeline artifacts<br/>AWS SDK / MinIO client
    API-->>Client: Pipeline created

    Note over Client,Cache: Pipeline Run Execution Flow
    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/runs<br/>Create pipeline run
    API->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview
    K8s-->>API: Authorized
    API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow<br/>SA: pipeline-runner
    K8s-->>Argo: Workflow event
    Argo->>Cache: Check execution cache<br/>Mutating webhook
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>Argo: Inject cached outputs
    else Cache Miss
        Argo->>Driver: Execute pipeline step
        Driver->>S3: Read input artifacts
        S3-->>Driver: Artifact data
        Driver->>Driver: Execute step logic
        Driver->>S3: Write output artifacts
        Driver-->>Argo: Step completed
    end

    Note over Client,Cache: State Synchronization Flow
    PA->>Argo: Watch workflow status<br/>argoproj.io/workflows
    Argo-->>PA: Workflow state change
    PA->>API: Report run status<br/>pipelines.kubeflow.org

    Note over Client,Cache: ML Metadata Flow
    MW->>K8s: Watch Argo Workflow pods
    K8s-->>MW: Pod status events
    MW->>Envoy: Write ML Metadata artifacts<br/>gRPC
    Envoy->>MLMD: Forward metadata<br/>gRPC
    MLMD->>MySQL: Persist metadata

    Note over Client,Cache: Admission Control Flow
    Client->>K8s: Create PipelineVersion CR
    K8s->>WH: POST /webhooks/validate-pipelineversion<br/>8443/TLS
    WH-->>K8s: Validation result
    K8s->>WH: POST /webhooks/mutate-pipelineversion<br/>8443/TLS
    WH-->>K8s: Mutated resource
    K8s-->>Client: PipelineVersion created

    Note over Client,Cache: UI Query Flow
    Client->>UI: Browse pipelines/runs<br/>HTTP/80
    UI->>API: Query pipeline data<br/>REST/8888
    API->>MySQL: Fetch metadata
    MySQL-->>API: Results
    API-->>UI: Pipeline/Run data
    UI-->>Client: Rendered UI
